# Nirva OS — Universal Cursor Context

> **You are working inside Nirva AI Core** — the control tower of the Nirvacore ecosystem.
> Production target: **https://ai.nirva.one** · Current API version: **0.16.0**
> Repo: https://github.com/Nirvacore/nirva-AI · Package: `nirva-dashboard`

---

## Vision

Nirva is an **AI Company Operating System** evolving into **Nirva AI Workspace** — an AI Brain Marketplace + Agent Workforce + Executive Dashboard + Coding Workspace. See `docs/NIRVA_BRAIN_OS.md`.

**Core pipeline:**
```
User → DESK (intent) → Agent Router → ROUTER (model tier) → Agent + Model → Plugins/Memory → REPORT
```

---

## Stack (v0.14.4)

| Layer | Tech |
|-------|------|
| Client | React 19, Vite 7, Tailwind CSS 4, Wouter, Sonner, Lucide, shadcn/ui (Radix) |
| Server | Express, better-sqlite3, WebSocket (`ws`) |
| AI | Ollama (LLM), Qdrant (vectors), n8n (workflows) |
| Shared | TypeScript monolith — `shared/` imported by client + server |
| Tooling | Vitest (56 unit), Playwright (24 e2e), Storybook, OpenAPI/Swagger |
| IDE | Cursor rules + MCP stdio server (`server/mcp/index.ts`) |

**Path aliases:** `@/*` → `client/src/*` · `@shared/*` → `shared/*`

---

## Repository map (every important path)

```
client/src/
  App.tsx              Routes + providers (Theme, Language, Live, Auth, Tenant)
  pages/               One file per route (see Routes below)
  components/          Sidebar, CommandPalette, LiveIndicator, ui/* (shadcn)
  contexts/            LiveContext, AuthContext, TenantContext, Theme, Language
  hooks/               useSettings, useTTS, useVoiceNavigation, useLive
  lib/api.ts           ALL client→server fetch (use apiFetch helper)
  lib/i18n.ts          17 locales

server/
  index.ts             HTTP server + static + WS init
  api.ts               ALL REST routes (createApiRouter)
  db/index.ts          SQLite persistence
  memory/              Qdrant RAG + embeddings
  obsidian/            Obsidian Local REST API client
  orchestration/       Model ROUTER usage tracking
  router/              Intent classifier + agent router
  ws/index.ts          WebSocket broadcast
  mcp/index.ts         MCP stdio server for Cursor
  auth/                OAuth + demo auth
  tenants/ plugins/ marketplace/ reports/ ecosystem/ n8n/
  middleware/          security, logger, CORS
  openapi/             spec + Swagger UI

shared/
  agents.ts            109 agents (name, role, tier, category)
  agent-prompts.ts     System prompts per agent
  agent-details.ts     Extended profiles
  organization.ts      8 AI Companies blueprint
  model-orchestration.ts  ROUTER tiers + model catalog
  ecosystem.ts         13 Nirvacore products
  settings.ts          NirvaSettings + localStorage
  tenants.ts plugins.ts marketplace.ts permissions.ts

deploy/
  manus/start.sh       Manus Space production start
  contabo/deploy.sh    VPS deploy script

docs/                  DEPLOY_*, AGENT_REGISTRY, MODEL_ORCHESTRATION, etc.
env/                   ai.nirva.one.env.example, contabo.prod.env.example
scripts/               setup, verify-production, manus-publish-config
e2e/                   Playwright smoke tests
.cursor/               mcp.json + rules/*.mdc
```

