## Client routes (Wouter)

| Path | Page | Purpose |
|------|------|---------|
| `/` | Home | Command Center dashboard |
| `/demo` | Demo | Feature showcase hub |
| `/ecosystem` | Ecosystem | 13 Nirvacore products health |
| `/organization` | Organization | 8 AI Companies org chart |
| `/orchestration` | Orchestration | Model ROUTER cost + tiers |
| `/brains` | Brains | AI Brain Marketplace + Brain Router |
| `/chat` | Chat | Agent chat + ROUTER live |
| `/memory` | Memory | Qdrant RAG + Obsidian vault |
| `/workflows` | Workflows | n8n templates + run |
| `/tasks` | Tasks | Task queue CRUD |
| `/reports` | Reports | Agent output reports |
| `/voice` | Voice | Wake word + TTS + nav |
| `/mindmap` | MindMap | Agent relationship graph |
| `/agents` | Agents | 109 agent directory |
| `/agents/:name` | AgentDetail | Single agent profile |
| `/marketplace` | Marketplace | Agent skill marketplace |
| `/plugins` | Plugins | Multi-tenant plugin system |
| `/docs` | Docs | In-app API docs link |
| `/files` | Files | File browser (planned) |
| `/terminal` | Terminal | CLI shell (planned) |
| `/settings` | Settings | LLM, API keys, Integrations, Voice |

Layout: fixed Sidebar 72px (224px on hover) + `main.ml-[72px]`

