## API routes (Express `/api/*`)

**Health:** `GET /health` `GET /metrics` `GET /system/status`
**Auth:** `GET /auth/me` `GET /auth/login` `POST /auth/demo-login` `POST /auth/logout` `GET /oauth/callback`
**Docs:** `GET /openapi.json` `GET /docs`
**Tenants:** `GET /tenants` `GET /tenants/current` `GET /tenants/:id` `POST /tenants`
**Plugins:** `GET /plugins` `GET /plugins/agent/:agentName` `POST /plugins/install` `PATCH /plugins/:id` `POST /plugins/:id/invoke`
**Organization:** `GET /organization` `GET /organization/router` `GET /permissions`
**Router:** `GET /router/classifier` `POST /router/analyze` `POST /router/execute`
**Orchestration:** `GET /orchestration` `GET /orchestration/cost` `GET /orchestration/recent` `POST /orchestration/route` `POST /orchestration/route-pipeline`
**Agents:** `GET /agents` `GET /agents/:name` `PATCH /agents/:name` `GET /agents/stats`
**Chat:** `POST /chat` `GET /chat/history` `POST /chat/tower` (Control Tower multi-agent)
**Tasks:** `GET /tasks` `POST /tasks` `PATCH /tasks/:id` `POST /tasks/:id/retry` `POST /tasks/:id/pause` `DELETE /tasks/:id`
**Memory:** `GET /memory` `POST /memory` `POST /memory/search` `DELETE /memory/:id` `GET /memory/stats`
**Obsidian:** `GET /obsidian/status` `GET /obsidian/notes` `POST /obsidian/sync` `POST /obsidian/search` `POST /obsidian/write`
**Marketplace:** `GET /marketplace` `GET /marketplace/stats` `GET /marketplace/:id` `POST /marketplace` `POST /marketplace/import-json` `POST /marketplace/:id/import` `POST /marketplace/:id/rate` `GET /marketplace/export/:agentName`
**Reports:** `GET /reports`
**Ecosystem:** `GET /ecosystem` `GET /ecosystem/apps` `GET /ecosystem/:id`
**Workflows:** `GET /workflows` `GET /workflows/templates` `POST /workflows/:id/run`
**Ollama:** `GET /ollama/models`

WebSocket: `ws://host/ws` — events: `connected`, `agent_stats`, `tasks`, `infrastructure`, `task_update`, `system_alert`

