## 109 Agents — categories (14)

Core Control Tower · Finance & Operations · Sales & Procurement · DESK Family · Operations & Quality · Teaching & Knowledge · Specialized Roles · Best Investigation · NIRVA TECH · MU UNIVERSE · Investment & Legal · Real-time Data · Media & Content · Teacher Module

**Control Tower:** DESK (Chief of Staff), FLOW (Ops), SAGE (Strategy), ROUTER (Model Manager — virtual)
**Key specialists:** CODE, ARCH, PIXEL, REACH, PRICE, GROW, BLOOM, VOICE, WAVE, COIN, CARE, TEACH, GATHER, SEAL, BULL, RAG-BUILDER, SHIP, GUARD, READ, STAMP, WIN

**Tiers:** `self-hosted` | `hybrid` | `cloud`
**Registry:** `shared/agents.ts` · **Prompts:** `shared/agent-prompts.ts` — add agent = both files

---

## 8 AI Companies (Organization)

Defined in `shared/organization.ts` → `AI_COMPANIES[]`:
software · commerce · media · service · business-support · knowledge · investment-legal · (+ control tower)

API: `GET /api/organization` renders full org tree from existing 109 agents (no new agents created).

