## Model ROUTER (Orchestration)

`shared/model-orchestration.ts` + `server/orchestration/`
**Tiers:** `free` (Ollama OSS) · `low_cost` · `premium` (cloud APIs)
**Settings:** `useOrchestration`, `maxPremiumPercent`, `preferSelfHosted` in NirvaSettings
Live in: Chat, Control Tower (`/chat/tower`), Orchestration page, Home cost widget

