| Service | URL | Env var |
|---------|-----|---------|
| Nirva API | http://localhost:3000 | `PORT`, `NIRVA_URL` (MCP) |
| Ollama | http://localhost:11434 | `VITE_OLLAMA_URL`, settings.ollamaUrl |
| Qdrant | http://localhost:6333 | `VITE_QDRANT_URL`, settings.qdrantUrl |
| n8n | http://localhost:5678 | `VITE_N8N_URL`, settings.n8nUrl |
| Obsidian | http://localhost:27124 | settings.obsidianUrl + obsidianApiKey |
| SQLite | ./data/nirva.db | `DATABASE_PATH` |

