## MCP Server (Cursor IDE)

Config: `.cursor/mcp.json` → `npx tsx server/mcp/index.ts`
**Tools:** chat_with_agent · search_memory · list_tasks · list_agents · check_infrastructure · search_obsidian
Run: `pnpm mcp` (API must be up at NIRVA_URL)

