## Settings (NirvaSettings)

`shared/settings.ts` → persisted localStorage via `loadClientSettings()` / `saveSettings()`
Fields: ollamaUrl, defaultModel, qdrantUrl, n8nUrl, useOrchestration, maxPremiumPercent, preferSelfHosted, ttsEnabled, ttsSpeed, wakeWord, notifyOnComplete, notifyOnError, obsidianUrl, obsidianApiKey, useObsidian
